    "pack": "Chapter Approved 2026-2027",
    "summary": "During your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), a friendly unit can start this **[action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions)** by picking an **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** in range, excluding your **home objective**. Any number of units may start, each with a different **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** that phase. If the unit controls the chosen **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** as your turn ends, your army counts it as **cleansed**.",
